  "behaviour": [
    "Every kobo that moves is a ledger row: payment captured, provider fee, VAT part, revenue line, refund, royalty accrual, payout.",
    "Append-only: a correction is a new reversing journal, never an update or delete.",
    "Amounts are integers in kobo; a journal's debits equal its credits or it is refused.",
